  "description": {
   "en": "The \"Girls Alliance'' is a gathering of selected girls with beautiful eyebrows and excellent grades. However, a shocking and bloody secret is hidden in the Girls' Alliance, which is a dream of all girls and is forbidden to boys. What awaited Kirie, who was suddenly allowed to join the Girls' Alliance, was a cruel trap...! Now, the bloody night has arrived! The flowers of love and hope fall. Dance with fear, girls !!\n\nA violent collection of tales of murder, evil experiments, and bizarre extreme content.\n\n1 ○ ***The Girl's Alliance*** (Shoujo Doumei) P2\n2 ○ ***Mimiko: I Don't Want to Become a God*** (Mimiko: Kami-sama ni Narimasu) P36\n3 ○ ***Two Beauties of Revenge*** (Urami no Sou Bijin) P124\n4 ○ ***Merry Christmas, Santa the Elder*** (Merry Christmas Santa Roujin) P168"
  },
